 317:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *         a tradeoff between performance and power consumption.
 318:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @param  VoltageScaling : Specifies the regulator output voltage scale.
 319:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *                          This parameter can be one of the following values :
 320:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *                          @arg @ref PWR_REGULATOR_VOLTAGE_SCALE1 : Regulator voltage output scal
 321:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *                                                                   Provides a typical output vol
 322:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *                                                                   Used when system clock freque
 323:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *                          @arg @ref PWR_REGULATOR_VOLTAGE_SCALE2 : Regulator voltage output scal
 324:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *                                                                   Provides a typical output vol
