2369:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @brief  Enable the SRAM4 memory fast wakeup from Stop 0, Stop 1 and Stop 2 modes.
2370:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @note   This bit is used to obtain the best trade-off between low-power consumption
2371:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *         and wakeup time. SRAM4 wakeup time increases the wakeup time when exiting
2372:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *         Stop 0, Stop 1 and Stop 2 modes, and also increases the LPDMA access time
2373:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *         to SRAM4 during Stop modes.
2374:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @retval None.
2375:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   */
