2443:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @brief  Disable pull-up and pull-down configuration.
2444:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @note   When APC bit is cleared, the I/O pull-up and pull-down configurations
