2625:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c **** /**
2626:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @brief Enable GPIO pull-down state in Standby and Shutdown modes.
2627:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @note  Set the relevant PDy bits of PWR_PDCRx register to configure the I/O
2628:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *        in pull-down state in Standby and Shutdown modes.
2629:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @note  This state is effective in Standby and Shutdown modes only if APC bit
2630:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *        is set through HAL_PWREx_EnablePullUpPullDownConfig() API.
2631:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @note  The configuration is lost when exiting the Shutdown mode due to the
2632:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *        power-on reset, maintained when exiting the Standby mode.
2633:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @note  To avoid any conflict at Standby and Shutdown modes exits, the
2634:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *        corresponding PUy bit of PWR_PUCRx register is cleared unless it is
2635:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *        reserved.
2636:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @note  Even if a PDy bit to set is reserved, the other PDy bits entered as
2637:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *        input parameter at the same time are set.
2638:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @param  GPIO_Port : Specify the IO port.
2639:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *                     This parameter can be a value of
2640:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *                     @ref PWREx_GPIO_Port.
2641:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @param  GPIO_Pin  : Specify the I/O pins numbers.
2642:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *                     This parameter can be a value of
2643:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *                     @ref PWREx_GPIO_Pin_Mask.
2644:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @retval HAL Status.
2645:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   */
